{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102360","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1310236001:0":{"text":"\"Step into the unknown and face the darkness\", \"unravel the long-forgotten tales\", \"explore the enigmatic spaces\"... Wow, all of this sounds fascinating!","source_cn":"“未知和黑暗”、“遗忘已久的故事”、“奇诡的空间”……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FD50309F6D3A907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310236002:0":{"text":"As a knight, Chippy welcomes such thrilling experiences!","source_cn":"身为骑士，就该挑战这种惊险刺激的项目！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48462DFB653B1CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1310236002":{"text":"As a knight, Chippy welcomes such thrilling experiences!","source_cn":"身为骑士，就该挑战这种惊险刺激的项目！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48462DFB653B1CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310236004:0":{"text":"Well, if I told you all the details, it wouldn't be any fun, right? I gotta leave you with a little mystery!","source_cn":"要是我都告诉你们了，就很无聊了啊。当然要给你们留一些小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x497E4816FA7800DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310236005:0":{"text":"Just head to the <style=\"highlight\">Frozen Paw</style>! You'll figure it out when you get there. It's to the northwest, across the bridge.","source_cn":"快去吧，到了<style=highlight>白熊温泉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F43DCDF7CC49EE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310236006:0":{"text":"Huh? Your Highness, you aren't coming with us?","source_cn":"咦？公主殿下，你不和我们一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8B98A5939A55B17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310236007:0":{"text":"I wish I could! But SOMEONE here would definitely stop me! Hmph!","source_cn":"我也很想，可是罗德里戈肯定会拦着我的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40531A43A4B8A69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310236008:0":{"text":"Your Highness, it's the Archduke's orders. He said you shouldn't exert yourself too much...","source_cn":"殿下，这是大公阁下的命令，他说您的身体还不适宜太劳累……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C27017F080554BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310236009:0":{"text":"But I'm feeling better now! My father always worries way too much!","source_cn":"明明我的病都已经好了……父亲总是这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1201C0419B8E579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1310236009":{"text":"But I'm feeling better now! My father always worries way too much!","source_cn":"明明我的病都已经好了……父亲总是这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1201C0419B8E579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310236010:0":{"text":"She had a serious illness about a year ago...","source_cn":"殿下一年前生了场重病……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94D506AB89D3207A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310236011:0":{"text":"That was a whole year ago! I'm totally fine now.","source_cn":"可我现在已经痊愈了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D2B75150530791A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310236013:0":{"text":"Your Highness, the Archduke is just worried about you...","source_cn":"殿下，大公阁下只是关心你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ADFE4C3EE6F19DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310236014:0":{"text":"*Sigh* I know, I'm just venting... I finally met some fun new friends, and I can't even join them on their adventure...","source_cn":"我知道……就是抱怨抱怨嘛，好不容易认识了这么有趣的新朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8579F6A194D9658E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1310236015:0":{"text":"Please don't be sad, Your Highness! Once we're done with this activity, we'll come back to Cedartown and find you!","source_cn":"别难过，公主殿下，我们参加完这个项目以后就回雪松镇找你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE23D1D841AD91954","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310236016:0":{"text":"Really? Do you pinky promise? Then don't forget, we'll all go to the <style=\"highlight\">masquerade ball</style> together!","source_cn":"真的？那你们可别忘了哦，到时候我们一起去参加<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD43271F2D3B27100","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310236017:0":{"text":"There's a ball during the festival too?","source_cn":"咦，祭典里还有舞会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9455A45FDC73994A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1310236018:0":{"text":"Do we have to wear masks?","source_cn":"那……是不是要戴上面具才能参加？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E3BECF1AFADAEF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1310236019:0":{"text":"Not really! Some people go all out with crazy masks and wild outfits, but others just come looking cute and ready to dance.","source_cn":"其实并没有那么多的要求。有人会戴上面具，把自己装扮得千...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FB7713AFDD5C0DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1310236020:0":{"text":"The ball is all about having fun and forgetting your worries, so dress however you want!","source_cn":"总之，舞会是为了让大家忘记烦恼、痛痛快快地玩乐而举办的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x917906DFE1FBDF49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1310236021:0":{"text":"And don't be shy! You can ask anyone nearby to dance—no one's gonna say no to being the star of the ball!","source_cn":"不要害羞哦，你可以找任何一位身边的人一起跳舞，没有人会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB88A7289B6FB1472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1310236022:0":{"text":"Wow, Chippy can't wait! Your Highness, Sir Chippy will definitely ask you to dance when the ball starts!","source_cn":"哇，我现在就开始期待了！公主殿下，等舞会开始，骑士满满...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4920235791DFF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1310236023:0":{"text":"Deal! When the time comes, each of you has to come and ask me for a dance!","source_cn":"那就这么说定了，等到了舞会上，你们每个人都得邀请我跳一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ACC8A4FF8172537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"Oh no! Were you sick?!","source_cn":"公主殿下生病了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB87754340D950BED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh no! Were you sick?!","female":"Oh no! Were you sick?!","variant_male_record_index":"68292","variant_female_record_index":"68293","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1310236012:0":{"text":"See? Even you think so! My father's the only one who's still worried...","source_cn":"看，你也觉得我很健康吧！只有父亲一个人不放心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26D42B0160FEB1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"You look quite healthy...","source_cn":"您看起来很健康……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02378D67D5E6A666","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You look quite healthy...","female":"You look quite healthy...","variant_male_record_index":"68294","variant_female_record_index":"68295","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Sounds kind of ominous...","source_cn":"这个项目到底是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC2517969E4F2F1E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sounds kind of ominous...","female":"Sounds kind of ominous...","variant_male_record_index":"68288","variant_female_record_index":"68289","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1310236003:0":{"text":"That's true. There aren't any details on the flyer, really...","source_cn":"的确，宣传单里都没有具体的游玩说明……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B6FB31E95195D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"This flyer is very vague.","source_cn":"宣传单说得很模糊……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA7177A5E3C4AC230","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This flyer is very vague.","female":"This flyer is very vague.","variant_male_record_index":"68290","variant_female_record_index":"68291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亚莲娜公主":{"text":"Princess Yolena","source":"亚莲娜公主","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"Captain Rodrigo","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":30,"localized_text_count":29,"speaker_count":4}}